cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Sparse Event-Based Neuromorphic Decoding for Implantable Brain–Computer Interfaces"
abstract: >-
  A controlled study of motor-cortex velocity decoding under progressively
  sparser spike streams on the Neural Latents Benchmark MC_RTT dataset,
  comparing a backprop-trained leaky integrate-and-fire spiking neural
  network against linear baselines and modelling the energy each design
  would consume on neuromorphic hardware.
type: software
